<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:01.233" end="00:00:03.666" style="s2">Ma&#39;am? Last stop. Chicago.</p>
<p begin="00:00:06.066" end="00:00:06.866" style="s2">Brett?</p>
<p begin="00:00:12.466" end="00:00:15.500" style="s2">My purse... My phone, my wallet, my ID.</p>
<p begin="00:00:15.666" end="00:00:17.000" style="s2">My mom&#39;s ring was in there.</p>
<p begin="00:00:17.433" end="00:00:18.800" style="s2">The gentleman you were with?</p>
<p begin="00:00:19.066" end="00:00:20.866" style="s2">He got off the second we pulled in.</p>
<p begin="00:00:33.133" end="00:01:01.030" style="s2">Brett! Brett!</p>
<p begin="00:01:02.100" end="00:01:05.733" style="s2">Ivy. By the time you read this, I&#39;m gone.</p>
<p begin="00:01:07.033" end="00:01:08.900" style="s2">I married you for your uncle&#39;s money.</p>
<p begin="00:01:09.400" end="00:01:10.833" style="s2">I got what I came for.</p>
<p begin="00:01:12.633" end="00:01:14.866" style="s2">You&#39;re a girl from a town with one stoplight.</p>
<p begin="00:01:15.600" end="00:01:17.133" style="s2">You don&#39;t belong in my world.</p>
<p begin="00:01:17.633" end="00:01:18.533" style="s2">You never did.</p>
<p begin="00:01:20.600" end="00:01:21.666" style="s2">Don&#39;t look for me.</p>
<p begin="00:01:22.333" end="00:01:24.133" style="s2">And don&#39;t go back to Harlow Ridge.</p>
<p begin="00:01:26.100" end="00:01:27.733" style="s2">Your uncle doesn&#39;t want you there.</p>
<p begin="00:01:28.033" end="00:01:28.900" style="s2">Neither do I.</p>
<p begin="00:01:34.000" end="00:01:36.133" style="s2">Yesterday he said &quot;till death do us part.&quot;</p>
<p begin="00:01:37.866" end="00:01:39.800" style="s2">Is there anybody who can come get you?</p>
<p begin="00:01:42.200" end="00:01:44.066" style="s2">I don&#39;t know a single person in this city.</p>
<p begin="00:01:45.066" end="00:01:47.300" style="s2">Then let&#39;s get you out of the station first, honey.</p>
<p begin="00:01:47.300" end="00:01:48.833" style="s2">We&#39;ll figure out the rest outside.</p>
<p begin="00:02:00.266" end="00:02:02.033" style="s2">Look at this. A bride,</p>
<p begin="00:02:02.066" end="00:02:03.033" style="s2">all by herself.</p>
<p begin="00:02:03.033" end="00:02:03.900" style="s2">Where&#39;s the groom?</p>
<p begin="00:02:04.100" end="00:02:05.266" style="s2">What&#39;s in the suitcase?</p>
<p begin="00:02:11.033" end="00:02:13.333" style="s2">Let go! That&#39;s all I&#39;ve got left!</p>
<p begin="00:02:14.620" end="00:02:15.200" style="s2">Not for long.</p>
<p begin="00:02:15.200" end="00:02:17.800" style="s2">Help!</p>
<p begin="00:02:18.600" end="00:02:19.866" style="s2">Somebody help me!</p>
<p begin="00:02:23.633" end="00:02:26.800" style="s2">Hey! Get your hands off that girl&#39;s suitcase!</p>
<p begin="00:02:32.600" end="00:02:34.600" style="s2">I already called 911.</p>
<p begin="00:02:34.800" end="00:02:38.033" style="s2">You two want to wait here for the cops? Be my guest.</p>
<p begin="00:02:39.833" end="00:02:40.733" style="s2">Crazy old lady!</p>
<p begin="00:02:46.100" end="00:02:48.066" style="s2">Okay. Okay, honey,</p>
<p begin="00:02:48.066" end="00:02:50.000" style="s2">they&#39;re gone. You&#39;re safe.</p>
<p begin="00:02:51.400" end="00:02:53.433" style="s2">Sweetheart, what happened to you?</p>
<p begin="00:02:53.733" end="00:02:54.700" style="s2">Where&#39;s your family?</p>
<p begin="00:02:56.700" end="00:02:58.300" style="s2">My husband left me on the train.</p>
<p begin="00:02:59.100" end="00:03:00.600" style="s2">He took everything I had.</p>
<p begin="00:03:03.300" end="00:03:04.633" style="s2">Well, you&#39;ve got me now.</p>
<p begin="00:03:04.900" end="00:03:08.000" style="s2">I&#39;m Maggie. And I&#39;m not leaving you out here alone.</p>
<p begin="00:03:08.500" end="00:03:13.033" style="s2">My café&#39;s right across the street. I&#39;m Ivy.</p>
<p begin="00:03:14.033" end="00:03:16.700" style="s2">Come on, Ivy. Let&#39;s get you off your feet.</p>
<p begin="00:03:26.633" end="00:03:28.733" style="s2">Eat first. Questions later.</p>
<p begin="00:03:30.466" end="00:03:31.800" style="s2">I don&#39;t want to be any trouble.</p>
<p begin="00:03:32.700" end="00:03:33.900" style="s2">I can&#39;t pay you.</p>
<p begin="00:03:34.066" end="00:03:35.266" style="s2">I don&#39;t have a dime.</p>
<p begin="00:03:36.533" end="00:03:38.700" style="s2">Did I ask for a dime? Eat.</p>
<p begin="00:03:48.300" end="00:03:49.100" style="s2">Hey, we—</p>
<p begin="00:03:49.133" end="00:03:49.933" style="s2">Oh, well.</p>
<p begin="00:03:51.733" end="00:03:52.800" style="s2">One second, folks.</p>
<p begin="00:03:52.800" end="00:03:54.100" style="s2">I&#39;ve only got two hands!</p>
<p begin="00:04:10.600" end="00:04:11.633" style="s2">Honey, sit down.</p>
<p begin="00:04:11.666" end="00:04:13.200" style="s2">You&#39;ve been through enough today.</p>
<p begin="00:04:13.633" end="00:04:14.600" style="s2">You helped me.</p>
<p begin="00:04:14.700" end="00:04:15.866" style="s2">Now let me help you.</p>
<p begin="00:04:19.466" end="00:04:21.133" style="s2">Thirty years I&#39;ve been coming here.</p>
<p begin="00:04:21.666" end="00:04:23.733" style="s2">Never once seen a bride bus tables.</p>
<p begin="00:04:25.700" end="00:04:26.933" style="s2">It&#39;s been a day of firsts.</p>
<p begin="00:04:32.133" end="00:04:39.200" style="s2">Maggie... could I work here?</p>
<p begin="00:04:39.933" end="00:04:41.833" style="s2">I&#39;ll do anything. Dishes, floors.</p>
<p begin="00:04:41.833" end="00:04:42.666" style="s2">I learn fast.</p>
<p begin="00:04:43.733" end="00:04:44.666" style="s2">Work for me?</p>
<p begin="00:04:48.433" end="00:04:51.466" style="s2">Honey, I&#39;ve been short a pair of hands since last spring.</p>
<p begin="00:04:52.233" end="00:04:54.000" style="s2">And there&#39;s an empty room upstairs.</p>
<p begin="00:04:55.033" end="00:04:56.733" style="s2">You&#39;re not going anywhere tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:04:59.800" end="00:05:03.400" style="s2">Thank you. I don&#39;t even know how to thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:05:03.933" end="00:05:05.066" style="s2">You just did.</p>
<p begin="00:05:05.933" end="00:05:07.133" style="s2">Look at that counter.</p>
<p begin="00:05:07.133" end="00:05:09.133" style="s2">It hasn&#39;t shined like that in years.</p>
<p begin="00:05:13.733" end="00:05:15.933" style="s2">Somebody called about two guys grabbing a suitcase?</p>
<p begin="00:05:16.933" end="00:05:21.100" style="s2">Two hours ago. Busy Sunday. Sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:05:21.400" end="00:05:22.200" style="s2">They get away?</p>
<p begin="00:05:23.000" end="00:05:25.233" style="s2">This girl ran like rabbits.</p>
<p begin="00:05:25.666" end="00:05:26.900" style="s2">But that&#39;s not all.</p>
<p begin="00:05:27.133" end="00:05:28.466" style="s2">This girl got robbed.</p>
<p begin="00:05:31.233" end="00:05:32.433" style="s2">What was taken, ma&#39;am?</p>
<p begin="00:05:33.500" end="00:05:36.233" style="s2">A white purse. My phone,</p>
<p begin="00:05:36.300" end="00:05:37.500" style="s2">my driver&#39;s license,</p>
<p begin="00:05:37.700" end="00:05:39.066" style="s2">three hundred dollars cash...</p>
<p begin="00:05:40.200" end="00:05:41.600" style="s2">and my mother&#39;s gold ring.</p>
<p begin="00:05:42.800" end="00:05:46.600" style="s2">It&#39;s a thin band, with an apple blossom engraved inside.</p>
<p begin="00:05:47.533" end="00:05:49.300" style="s2">It&#39;s the only thing of hers I had.</p>
<p begin="00:05:49.600" end="00:05:50.500" style="s2">Who took it?</p>
<p begin="00:05:53.000" end="00:05:55.400" style="s2">My husband. Brett Mercer.</p>
<p begin="00:06:01.733" end="00:06:02.533" style="s2">Your husband.</p>
<p begin="00:06:03.633" end="00:06:06.233" style="s2">Then the DA is probably gonna treat it like a family thing.</p>
<p begin="00:06:06.666" end="00:06:07.633" style="s2">But—</p>
<p begin="00:06:09.500" end="00:06:10.666" style="s2">If he sells that ring,</p>
<p begin="00:06:10.733" end="00:06:11.600" style="s2">that&#39;s theft.</p>
<p begin="00:06:12.133" end="00:06:13.833" style="s2">Every pawnshop in this city has</p>
<p begin="00:06:13.833" end="00:06:15.033" style="s2">to report what comes through the door.</p>
<p begin="00:06:16.100" end="00:06:17.066" style="s2">Hang on to that number.</p>
<p begin="00:06:29.133" end="00:06:30.300" style="s2">Could I use your phone?</p>
<p begin="00:06:30.633" end="00:06:31.800" style="s2">I need to call home.</p>
<p begin="00:06:33.233" end="00:06:34.233" style="s2">Go ahead, honey.</p>
<p begin="00:06:38.033" end="00:06:38.833" style="s2">Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:06:39.666" end="00:06:41.700" style="s2">Uncle Walt, it&#39;s me.</p>
<p begin="00:06:42.333" end="00:06:43.466" style="s2">Brett left me on the train.</p>
<p begin="00:06:44.433" end="00:06:47.900" style="s2">He took my purse, my phone, Mom&#39;s ring—</p>
<p begin="00:06:50.133" end="00:06:51.666" style="s2">That&#39;s between you and your husband.</p>
<p begin="00:06:52.200" end="00:06:53.533" style="s2">You&#39;re his wife now.</p>
<p begin="00:06:53.900" end="00:06:54.900" style="s2">Can I come home?</p>
<p begin="00:06:59.200" end="00:07:00.266" style="s2">Listen to me, Ivy.</p>
<p begin="00:07:00.833" end="00:07:01.900" style="s2">Don&#39;t come back.</p>
<p begin="00:07:02.400" end="00:07:04.133" style="s2">Don&#39;t you ever come back here.</p>
<p begin="00:07:12.466" end="00:07:14.933" style="s2">This one&#39;s yours now. Get some rest.</p>
<p begin="00:07:16.833" end="00:07:18.233" style="s2">I can really stay here?</p>
<p begin="00:07:18.800" end="00:07:19.933" style="s2">As long as you want.</p>
<p begin="00:07:20.133" end="00:07:21.666" style="s2">This house is yours too.</p>
<p begin="00:07:23.200" end="00:07:25.433" style="s2">I won&#39;t let you down. I promise.</p>
<p begin="00:07:27.600" end="00:07:30.333" style="s2">These were mine, about a hundred years ago.</p>
<p begin="00:07:30.833" end="00:07:31.933" style="s2">They&#39;ll do for now.</p>
<p begin="00:07:38.733" end="00:07:39.600" style="s2">What are you making?</p>
<p begin="00:07:41.033" end="00:07:43.600" style="s2">My mom&#39;s apple cinnamon tea.</p>
<p begin="00:07:44.333" end="00:07:46.233" style="s2">My mom made it every time I got sick.</p>
<p begin="00:07:47.066" end="00:07:48.866" style="s2">We have an apple orchard back home.</p>
<p begin="00:07:54.066" end="00:07:55.133" style="s2">Oh, that&#39;s good.</p>
<p begin="00:07:55.666" end="00:07:59.833" style="s2">Your mama must have loved you.</p>
<p begin="00:08:00.633" end="00:08:01.933" style="s2">She did. I miss her every day.</p>
<p begin="00:08:02.500" end="00:08:05.933" style="s2">I lost a daughter. A long time ago.</p>
<p begin="00:08:09.700" end="00:08:11.266" style="s2">Then we&#39;ve got each other now.</p>
<p begin="00:08:17.133" end="00:08:18.233" style="s2">You&#39;re keeping those?</p>
<p begin="00:08:18.633" end="00:08:20.000" style="s2">I&#39;d have thrown them in the river.</p>
<p begin="00:08:21.733" end="00:08:22.833" style="s2">It&#39;s not for him.</p>
<p begin="00:08:24.400" end="00:08:26.700" style="s2">I&#39;m keeping them so I remember the day I was a fool.</p>
<p begin="00:08:32.100" end="00:08:34.066" style="s2">That&#39;s three nights now. You haven&#39;t slept.</p>
<p begin="00:08:34.866" end="00:08:36.500" style="s2">I know. I just can&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:08:37.233" end="00:08:38.500" style="s2">You skipped dinner too.</p>
<p begin="00:08:38.833" end="00:08:40.100" style="s2">You can&#39;t keep doing this.</p>
<p begin="00:08:42.300" end="00:08:43.133" style="s2">Since Dad died,</p>
<p begin="00:08:43.133" end="00:08:46.400" style="s2">this place has everything in it. Except life.</p>
<p begin="00:08:51.633" end="00:08:52.866" style="s2">Where are you going at this hour?</p>
<p begin="00:08:54.066" end="00:08:55.900" style="s2">A walk. I need some air.</p>
<p begin="00:08:56.066" end="00:08:57.666" style="s2">Don&#39;t drive. Not like this.</p>
<p begin="00:08:57.666" end="00:08:58.466" style="s2">I&#39;m walking.</p>
<p begin="00:09:03.900" end="00:09:06.300" style="s2">Evening. We&#39;re about to close.</p>
<p begin="00:09:08.333" end="00:09:09.700" style="s2">Just a double espresso.</p>
<p begin="00:09:09.700" end="00:09:13.033" style="s2">As strong as you&#39;ve got.</p>
<p begin="00:09:13.266" end="00:09:14.100" style="s2">Espresso? At this hour?</p>
<p begin="00:09:14.733" end="00:09:16.633" style="s2">Are you planning on sleeping at all tonight?</p>
<p begin="00:09:20.800" end="00:09:22.100" style="s2">Sleep&#39;s not really my thing.</p>
<p begin="00:09:24.466" end="00:09:25.800" style="s2">Then you need something else.</p>
<p begin="00:09:29.433" end="00:09:30.300" style="s2">Like what?</p>
<p begin="00:09:33.400" end="00:09:35.433" style="s2">Apple cinnamon tea. No caffeine.</p>
<p begin="00:09:38.100" end="00:09:39.800" style="s2">Tea. I asked for coffee.</p>
<p begin="00:09:41.200" end="00:09:42.000" style="s2">Trust me.</p>
<p begin="00:09:44.033" end="00:09:45.133" style="s2">Any sugar in it?</p>
<p begin="00:09:45.466" end="00:09:46.800" style="s2">Just what the apples bring.</p>
<p begin="00:09:50.833" end="00:09:52.633" style="s2">That&#39;s... really good.</p>
<p begin="00:09:52.833" end="00:09:54.100" style="s2">Told ya.</p>
<p begin="00:09:54.233" end="00:09:55.433" style="s2">Beats another espresso.</p>
<p begin="00:09:57.000" end="00:09:57.800" style="s2">Keep the change.</p>
<p begin="00:09:57.900" end="00:09:58.600" style="s2">You earned it.</p>
<p begin="00:10:01.400" end="00:10:02.266" style="s2">It&#39;s three dollars.</p>
<p begin="00:10:02.833" end="00:10:03.633" style="s2">Not a hundred.</p>
<p begin="00:10:04.433" end="00:10:05.500" style="s2">You don&#39;t take tips?</p>
<p begin="00:10:08.100" end="00:10:10.133" style="s2">Not the kind that feel like charity. Five, then.</p>
<p begin="00:10:16.666" end="00:10:18.100" style="s2">Guess I&#39;ll have to come back tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:10:19.933" end="00:10:21.066" style="s2">You can come back.</p>
<p begin="00:10:21.533" end="00:10:23.433" style="s2">Just don&#39;t order espresso at midnight.</p>
<p begin="00:10:28.500" end="00:10:29.800" style="s2">Goodnight... Ivy.</p>
<p begin="00:10:30.333" end="00:10:31.666" style="s2">I&#39;m Adrian, by the way.</p>
<p begin="00:10:36.433" end="00:10:38.133" style="s2">Who was that smile for?</p>
<p begin="00:10:40.000" end="00:10:41.800" style="s2">Just a strange customer.</p>
<p begin="00:10:44.500" end="00:10:47.533" style="s2">A strange customer who makes you smile like that?</p>
<p begin="00:10:47.833" end="00:10:48.900" style="s2">I&#39;ll take it.</p>
<p begin="00:10:52.666" end="00:10:53.466" style="s2">You&#39;re smiling.</p>
<p begin="00:10:54.066" end="00:10:55.900" style="s2">Found a little café by the train station.</p>
<p begin="00:10:56.266" end="00:11:00.433" style="s2">The café?</p>
<p begin="00:11:01.066" end="00:11:02.400" style="s2">Or somebody in it?</p>
<p begin="00:11:04.600" end="00:11:06.066" style="s2">Let&#39;s call it a happy accident.</p>
<p begin="00:11:11.533" end="00:11:13.100" style="s2">You&#39;re back.</p>
<p begin="00:11:13.600" end="00:11:15.066" style="s2">No espresso this time.</p>
<p begin="00:11:16.300" end="00:11:17.800" style="s2">So you came back for the tea.</p>
<p begin="00:11:19.300" end="00:11:20.400" style="s2">Maybe for the conversation.</p>
<p begin="00:11:24.666" end="00:11:26.366" style="s2">Did you sleep last night? Like a rock.</p>
<p begin="00:11:28.900" end="00:11:30.000" style="s2">First time in months.</p>
<p begin="00:11:30.433" end="00:11:35.400" style="s2">Where did you get the recipe? My mom. She&#39;s gone.</p>
<p begin="00:11:36.800" end="00:11:37.800" style="s2">Five years ago.</p>
<p begin="00:11:38.633" end="00:11:39.800" style="s2">I still miss her.</p>
<p begin="00:11:44.866" end="00:11:46.433" style="s2">Then it&#39;s not just a recipe.</p>
<p begin="00:11:48.133" end="00:11:49.833" style="s2">I know what lonely feels like.</p>
<p begin="00:11:50.200" end="00:11:51.000" style="s2">You?</p>
<p begin="00:11:53.800" end="00:11:56.633" style="s2">You can have a house full of things and nobody to talk to.</p>
<p begin="00:11:59.066" end="00:12:02.533" style="s2">Well, here you&#39;ve got tea. And somebody to talk to.</p>
<p begin="00:12:05.800" end="00:12:06.833" style="s2">Is this place yours?</p>
<p begin="00:12:10.133" end="00:12:11.300" style="s2">It&#39;s Maggie&#39;s.</p>
<p begin="00:12:12.700" end="00:12:13.733" style="s2">When I had nothing,</p>
<p begin="00:12:14.466" end="00:12:15.500" style="s2">she took me in.</p>
<p begin="00:12:17.933" end="00:12:19.866" style="s2">Ivy, they overcharged us again!</p>
<p begin="00:12:21.233" end="00:12:22.066" style="s2">Supplier bills?</p>
<p begin="00:12:22.400" end="00:12:24.733" style="s2">Every week. Same order, bigger bill.</p>
<p begin="00:12:28.833" end="00:12:30.600" style="s2">Look. Same invoice number.</p>
<p begin="00:12:30.666" end="00:12:31.866" style="s2">Forty-four seventy-one.</p>
<p begin="00:12:31.900" end="00:12:32.700" style="s2">Billed twice.</p>
<p begin="00:12:34.866" end="00:12:36.300" style="s2">How&#39;d you catch that so fast?</p>
<p begin="00:12:37.066" end="00:12:38.500" style="s2">I look at numbers all day.</p>
<p begin="00:12:39.433" end="00:12:40.533" style="s2">You keep the old ones?</p>
<p begin="00:12:41.633" end="00:12:44.600" style="s2">Every one. I just never knew how to check them.</p>
<p begin="00:12:47.100" end="00:12:49.800" style="s2">Teach me. I want to be able to do it myself.</p>
<p begin="00:12:56.433" end="00:12:57.600" style="s2">Start with the quantities.</p>
<p begin="00:13:03.133" end="00:13:05.866" style="s2">Wait. The unit prices are different.</p>
<p begin="00:13:08.200" end="00:13:10.333" style="s2">Good. And the quantities?</p>
<p begin="00:13:11.700" end="00:13:15.066" style="s2">Same. So he&#39;s charging us more for every single thing.</p>
<p begin="00:13:15.266" end="00:13:16.666" style="s2">And we&#39;ve just been paying it.</p>
<p begin="00:13:18.266" end="00:13:19.200" style="s2">Remember one thing.</p>
<p begin="00:13:19.933" end="00:13:21.866" style="s2">People who cheat you are lazy.</p>
<p begin="00:13:22.833" end="00:13:24.200" style="s2">If a trick works once,</p>
<p begin="00:13:24.433" end="00:13:25.500" style="s2">they&#39;ll use it again.</p>
<p begin="00:13:26.066" end="00:13:27.600" style="s2">So look for repeats first.</p>
<p begin="00:13:32.233" end="00:13:33.300" style="s2">Look for repeats.</p>
<p begin="00:13:34.900" end="00:13:36.333" style="s2">And before anything else,</p>
<p begin="00:13:36.866" end="00:13:37.733" style="s2">pull the contract.</p>
<p begin="00:13:39.500" end="00:13:41.233" style="s2">It&#39;s in the drawer with the receipts.</p>
<p begin="00:13:45.433" end="00:13:46.800" style="s2">He delivers tomorrow morning.</p>
<p begin="00:13:46.933" end="00:13:47.933" style="s2">I&#39;ll talk to him.</p>
<p begin="00:13:48.833" end="00:13:50.500" style="s2">Then I&#39;ll be here tomorrow morning too.</p>
<p begin="00:13:51.233" end="00:13:52.400" style="s2">Just save me a cup.</p>
<p begin="00:13:58.800" end="00:14:01.200" style="s2">Morning. Usual order. Sign here.</p>
<p begin="00:14:02.400" end="00:14:03.266" style="s2">Hold on, Gary.</p>
<p begin="00:14:03.266" end="00:14:04.233" style="s2">We need to talk.</p>
<p begin="00:14:04.833" end="00:14:09.533" style="s2">Some of these bills don&#39;t add up. What now?</p>
<p begin="00:14:12.000" end="00:14:14.133" style="s2">Invoice forty-four seventy-one.</p>
<p begin="00:14:14.666" end="00:14:16.066" style="s2">You billed us for it twice.</p>
<p begin="00:14:17.300" end="00:14:19.333" style="s2">And your prices don&#39;t match the contract.</p>
<p begin="00:14:20.033" end="00:14:21.500" style="s2">You owe us an explanation.</p>
<p begin="00:14:25.266" end="00:14:26.633" style="s2">That doesn&#39;t prove anything.</p>
<p begin="00:14:28.900" end="00:14:29.800" style="s2">Everything okay?</p>
<p begin="00:14:32.500" end="00:14:33.800" style="s2">He overcharged us,</p>
<p begin="00:14:33.866" end="00:14:35.100" style="s2">and he won&#39;t pay it back.</p>
<p begin="00:14:35.533" end="00:14:36.500" style="s2">Stay out of it, pal.</p>
<p begin="00:14:36.500" end="00:14:37.633" style="s2">This is none of your business.</p>
<p begin="00:14:39.200" end="00:14:40.900" style="s2">If you&#39;re cheating these two, it is.</p>
<p begin="00:14:41.433" end="00:14:43.466" style="s2">Invoices, contract.</p>
<p begin="00:14:44.100" end="00:14:45.466" style="s2">It&#39;s all in black and white.</p>
<p begin="00:14:45.866" end="00:14:47.333" style="s2">You can argue with it here,</p>
<p begin="00:14:48.000" end="00:14:49.433" style="s2">or you can argue with the judge.</p>
<p begin="00:14:50.033" end="00:14:50.833" style="s2">Mr. Co—</p>
<p begin="00:14:56.100" end="00:14:57.266" style="s2">No need for lawyers.</p>
<p begin="00:14:57.500" end="00:15:00.700" style="s2">I&#39;ll pay back the difference. In writing.</p>
<p begin="00:15:07.300" end="00:15:08.433" style="s2">And from now on,</p>
<p begin="00:15:08.633" end="00:15:10.433" style="s2">you deliver on the dates in the contract.</p>
<p begin="00:15:12.500" end="00:15:14.300" style="s2">Sure. Absolutely.</p>
<p begin="00:15:21.000" end="00:15:26.233" style="s2">Oh! Look at you!</p>
<p begin="00:15:26.733" end="00:15:28.866" style="s2">Thank you. Really. You didn&#39;t have to step in.</p>
<p begin="00:15:30.000" end="00:15:31.033" style="s2">You found the proof.</p>
<p begin="00:15:32.200" end="00:15:33.333" style="s2">I just stood there.</p>
<p begin="00:15:35.300" end="00:15:37.833" style="s2">Maggie gave me a home. I owe her.</p>
<p begin="00:15:42.600" end="00:15:43.866" style="s2">That explains a lot.</p>
<p begin="00:15:44.100" end="00:15:45.733" style="s2">The way Gary looked at you...</p>
<p begin="00:15:46.233" end="00:15:47.800" style="s2">like he&#39;d seen a ghost.</p>
<p begin="00:15:48.933" end="00:15:50.633" style="s2">What do you do, exactly?</p>
<p begin="00:15:51.333" end="00:15:53.400" style="s2">I&#39;m... in the hotel business.</p>
<p begin="00:15:55.733" end="00:15:57.033" style="s2">That explains the numbers.</p>
<p begin="00:15:59.400" end="00:16:01.033" style="s2">Let&#39;s just say I had good teachers.</p>
<p begin="00:16:03.033" end="00:16:04.233" style="s2">What about you, Ivy?</p>
<p begin="00:16:04.700" end="00:16:05.633" style="s2">What do you want?</p>
<p begin="00:16:13.066" end="00:16:15.933" style="s2">Someday? A café of my own.</p>
<p begin="00:16:18.533" end="00:16:20.500" style="s2">Then why not start getting ready now?</p>
<p begin="00:16:21.200" end="00:16:22.600" style="s2">I could teach you a few things.</p>
<p begin="00:16:24.033" end="00:16:25.633" style="s2">So now you&#39;re a teacher too?</p>
<p begin="00:16:26.600" end="00:16:27.533" style="s2">Not a teacher.</p>
<p begin="00:16:28.066" end="00:16:32.233" style="s2">I just know how a business runs.</p>
<p begin="00:16:32.233" end="00:16:34.666" style="s2">Okay. But no hard homework.</p>
<p begin="00:16:37.533" end="00:16:39.266" style="s2">How much bread do you throw out every day?</p>
<p begin="00:16:42.200" end="00:16:43.100" style="s2">About a basket.</p>
<p begin="00:16:43.466" end="00:16:44.633" style="s2">It all goes in the trash.</p>
<p begin="00:16:44.633" end="00:16:46.233" style="s2">So... that&#39;s money too.</p>
<p begin="00:16:50.933" end="00:16:52.733" style="s2">You&#39;re picking this up faster than I expected.</p>
<p begin="00:16:55.400" end="00:16:56.533" style="s2">When my mom was alive,</p>
<p begin="00:16:56.533" end="00:16:59.933" style="s2">I did the books with her every Sunday. For our farm stand.</p>
<p begin="00:17:03.833" end="00:17:06.866" style="s2">Last lesson. It&#39;s not in any textbook.</p>
<p begin="00:17:07.733" end="00:17:09.866" style="s2">The harder someone pushes you to sign something,</p>
<p begin="00:17:10.333" end="00:17:11.900" style="s2">the more carefully you read it.</p>
<p begin="00:17:15.500" end="00:17:16.800" style="s2">The morning of my wedding...</p>
<p begin="00:17:17.866" end="00:17:19.333" style="s2">I signed a whole stack of papers.</p>
<p begin="00:17:19.433" end="00:17:20.500" style="s2">I didn&#39;t read a word.</p>
<p begin="00:17:21.833" end="00:17:25.800" style="s2">My uncle said they were farm papers. So he could look</p>
<p begin="00:17:25.800" end="00:17:27.666" style="s2">after the orchard while I was on my honeymoon.</p>
<p begin="00:17:28.333" end="00:17:31.433" style="s2">What orchard? It&#39;s a long story.</p>
<p begin="00:17:32.133" end="00:17:33.266" style="s2">I&#39;ve got all night.</p>
<p begin="00:17:36.033" end="00:17:37.700" style="s2">I never thought I&#39;d end up here.</p>
<p begin="00:17:38.933" end="00:17:40.533" style="s2">My dad died when I was little.</p>
<p begin="00:17:42.033" end="00:17:43.866" style="s2">My mom passed five years ago.</p>
<p begin="00:17:45.400" end="00:17:47.000" style="s2">She left the orchard to me in a trust.</p>
<p begin="00:17:49.700" end="00:17:50.800" style="s2">Until I turn twenty-five,</p>
<p begin="00:17:50.800" end="00:17:52.200" style="s2">my uncle Walt runs it.</p>
<p begin="00:17:53.466" end="00:17:55.600" style="s2">He always said the place was drowning in debt.</p>
<p begin="00:17:55.866" end="00:17:57.800" style="s2">That I was just one more mouth to feed.</p>
<p begin="00:17:59.500" end="00:18:00.466" style="s2">Four months ago,</p>
<p begin="00:18:00.600" end="00:18:01.733" style="s2">Brett showed up in town.</p>
<p begin="00:18:03.000" end="00:18:04.900" style="s2">Said he was scouting land for a client.</p>
<p begin="00:18:05.500" end="00:18:06.733" style="s2">He was so good to me...</p>
<p begin="00:18:07.400" end="00:18:08.700" style="s2">I thought he was the one.</p>
<p begin="00:18:08.933" end="00:18:10.233" style="s2">My uncle gave him money.</p>
<p begin="00:18:10.900" end="00:18:11.933" style="s2">Called it a wedding present.</p>
<p begin="00:18:15.266" end="00:18:16.066" style="s2">After the wedding,</p>
<p begin="00:18:16.066" end="00:18:17.700" style="s2">my uncle hugged me and said,</p>
<p begin="00:18:18.833" end="00:18:20.300" style="s2">&quot;Take a nice long honeymoon.</p>
<p begin="00:18:20.633" end="00:18:24.100" style="s2">Don&#39;t hurry back.&quot; And Brett?</p>
<p begin="00:18:27.433" end="00:18:28.400" style="s2">He got his money.</p>
<p begin="00:18:28.400" end="00:18:29.633" style="s2">He didn&#39;t need me anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:18:31.000" end="00:18:32.666" style="s2">So while I was asleep on the train,</p>
<p begin="00:18:33.433" end="00:18:34.466" style="s2">he took my things,</p>
<p begin="00:18:34.600" end="00:18:36.266" style="s2">left me a letter, and walked away.</p>
<p begin="00:18:39.466" end="00:18:41.300" style="s2">Maggie&#39;s the one who saved me.</p>
<p begin="00:18:41.830" end="00:18:43.030" style="s2">So what now?</p>
<p begin="00:18:45.233" end="00:18:46.733" style="s2">I&#39;m not going back to him.</p>
<p begin="00:18:47.266" end="00:18:48.733" style="s2">I want this marriage over.</p>
<p begin="00:18:50.533" end="00:18:51.733" style="s2">You&#39;re not alone, Ivy.</p>
<p begin="00:18:52.233" end="00:18:53.200" style="s2">You&#39;ve got me.</p>
<p begin="00:18:55.066" end="00:18:56.333" style="s2">I needed to hear that.</p>
<p begin="00:18:58.233" end="00:19:00.000" style="s2">Tomorrow, we find you a lawyer.</p>
<p begin="00:19:03.266" end="00:19:04.733" style="s2">I can&#39;t afford a lawyer.</p>
<p begin="00:19:06.066" end="00:19:08.700" style="s2">Then we find you a free one. Legal aid.</p>
<p begin="00:19:17.266" end="00:19:18.533" style="s2">He wrote it himself.</p>
<p begin="00:19:19.800" end="00:19:21.233" style="s2">&quot;I married you for the money.&quot;</p>
<p begin="00:19:22.033" end="00:19:23.200" style="s2">&quot;Don&#39;t look for me.&quot;</p>
<p begin="00:19:24.200" end="00:19:26.100" style="s2">He walked out the morning after the wedding.</p>
<p begin="00:19:26.500" end="00:19:29.200" style="s2">We can ask the court to declare the marriage void.</p>
<p begin="00:19:31.066" end="00:19:32.900" style="s2">Fraud. Legally, it&#39;ll be like it never happened.</p>
<p begin="00:19:34.600" end="00:19:35.833" style="s2">How long does that take?</p>
<p begin="00:19:36.600" end="00:19:37.900" style="s2">First he has to be served.</p>
<p begin="00:19:38.800" end="00:19:39.900" style="s2">He can fight it.</p>
<p begin="00:19:40.533" end="00:19:41.800" style="s2">If it goes smoothly,</p>
<p begin="00:19:42.300" end="00:19:43.133" style="s2">a few months.</p>
<p begin="00:19:44.300" end="00:19:46.833" style="s2">In Illinois, you&#39;ve got ninety days from the day</p>
<p begin="00:19:46.833" end="00:19:48.133" style="s2">you found out you were tricked. You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:19:48.666" end="00:19:49.900" style="s2">well within that.</p>
<p begin="00:19:52.833" end="00:19:53.700" style="s2">Then I&#39;ll wait.</p>
<p begin="00:19:54.700" end="00:19:56.533" style="s2">What about the papers I signed for my uncle?</p>
<p begin="00:19:59.733" end="00:20:01.833" style="s2">He&#39;s your trustee till you&#39;re twenty-five.</p>
<p begin="00:20:02.066" end="00:20:03.533" style="s2">He doesn&#39;t have to show you a thing.</p>
<p begin="00:20:03.900" end="00:20:05.100" style="s2">I&#39;ll ask anyway.</p>
<p begin="00:20:06.200" end="00:20:08.300" style="s2">And that police report for your mother&#39;s ring?</p>
<p begin="00:20:08.800" end="00:20:09.733" style="s2">Don&#39;t lose it.</p>
<p begin="00:20:22.200" end="00:20:24.033" style="s2">Tonight, we forget about all of it.</p>
<p begin="00:20:25.666" end="00:20:26.466" style="s2">It&#39;s beautiful.</p>
<p begin="00:20:26.700" end="00:20:28.033" style="s2">I&#39;ve never been down here.</p>
<p begin="00:20:29.066" end="00:20:31.400" style="s2">What do you miss most? About home.</p>
<p begin="00:20:34.600" end="00:20:37.300" style="s2">Our red barn. My mom painted a white</p>
<p begin="00:20:37.300" end="00:20:39.300" style="s2">apple blossom on the side.</p>
<p begin="00:20:39.333" end="00:20:40.533" style="s2">You can see it from the road.</p>
<p begin="00:20:46.700" end="00:20:48.133" style="s2">With you, I can breathe again.</p>
<p begin="00:20:49.900" end="00:20:51.600" style="s2">With you, I remember how to laugh.</p>
<p begin="00:20:54.300" end="00:20:56.233" style="s2">Do I really matter that much to you?</p>
<p begin="00:20:58.033" end="00:20:59.100" style="s2">More than you know.</p>
<p begin="00:21:08.066" end="00:21:09.400" style="s2">So you&#39;re the tea girl.</p>
<p begin="00:21:09.866" end="00:21:10.900" style="s2">I&#39;ll have a cup.</p>
<p begin="00:21:11.400" end="00:21:12.866" style="s2">I hear somebody comes all the way</p>
<p begin="00:21:12.866" end="00:21:14.433" style="s2">down here every night for it.</p>
<p begin="00:21:19.233" end="00:21:21.033" style="s2">Rustic. Where are you from?</p>
<p begin="00:21:21.900" end="00:21:23.733" style="s2">Michigan. An apple orchard.</p>
<p begin="00:21:26.333" end="00:21:27.233" style="s2">Michigan land.</p>
<p begin="00:21:28.033" end="00:21:29.600" style="s2">It&#39;s been going cheap lately.</p>
<p begin="00:21:31.066" end="00:21:32.800" style="s2">Is there something I can help you with?</p>
<p begin="00:21:35.300" end="00:21:38.400" style="s2">My nephew has skipped three dinners at the Ashfords&#39;.</p>
<p begin="00:21:38.900" end="00:21:41.700" style="s2">So I had my driver find out where he goes at night.</p>
<p begin="00:21:45.066" end="00:21:46.266" style="s2">Do you know who he is?</p>
<p begin="00:21:47.000" end="00:21:49.866" style="s2">Adrian Cole. Cole Hotel Group.</p>
<p begin="00:21:50.233" end="00:21:52.333" style="s2">Forty hotels. All his.</p>
<p begin="00:21:54.433" end="00:21:56.033" style="s2">He said he was in the hotel business.</p>
<p begin="00:21:57.733" end="00:21:59.866" style="s2">Well. He is.</p>
<p begin="00:22:04.466" end="00:22:07.100" style="s2">Fifty thousand. Leave Chicago.</p>
<p begin="00:22:08.000" end="00:22:10.866" style="s2">A man like Adrian marries a woman from his own world.</p>
<p begin="00:22:19.900" end="00:22:22.200" style="s2">My dignity is not for sale, Ms. Cole.</p>
<p begin="00:22:23.866" end="00:22:25.500" style="s2">You can choose where your money goes.</p>
<p begin="00:22:26.700" end="00:22:28.500" style="s2">You don&#39;t get to choose where I stand.</p>
<p begin="00:22:32.066" end="00:22:33.466" style="s2">Everyone has a price, dear.</p>
<p begin="00:22:36.866" end="00:22:38.333" style="s2">Then you&#39;ve got the wrong guy.</p>
<p begin="00:22:42.933" end="00:22:45.233" style="s2">Celeste. That&#39;s enough.</p>
<p begin="00:22:47.200" end="00:22:50.200" style="s2">I&#39;m protecting your future.</p>
<p begin="00:22:51.700" end="00:22:53.266" style="s2">My future&#39;s mine to decide.</p>
<p begin="00:22:54.200" end="00:22:55.200" style="s2">Show her some respect.</p>
<p begin="00:22:58.533" end="00:22:59.333" style="s2">We&#39;ll see.</p>
<p begin="00:23:05.600" end="00:23:08.966" style="s2">Cole Hotel Group? Ivy—</p>
<p begin="00:23:11.133" end="00:23:13.400" style="s2">That&#39;s why Gary went white when he saw you.</p>
<p begin="00:23:15.866" end="00:23:17.900" style="s2">I told you everything about my life.</p>
<p begin="00:23:19.266" end="00:23:21.133" style="s2">And you let me think you worked at a hotel?</p>
<p begin="00:23:22.000" end="00:23:22.900" style="s2">I didn&#39;t lie.</p>
<p begin="00:23:23.800" end="00:23:25.333" style="s2">I am in the hotel business.</p>
<p begin="00:23:27.000" end="00:23:29.900" style="s2">I just... own forty of them.</p>
<p begin="00:23:30.833" end="00:23:32.700" style="s2">I wanted you to know me without the money.</p>
<p begin="00:23:40.000" end="00:23:41.500" style="s2">The last man who lied to me about</p>
<p begin="00:23:41.500" end="00:23:42.933" style="s2">who he was left me on a train.</p>
<p begin="00:23:46.033" end="00:23:47.633" style="s2">I know. I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:23:50.266" end="00:23:52.066" style="s2">I need some time to think, Adrian.</p>
<p begin="00:23:53.900" end="00:23:54.800" style="s2">I understand.</p>
<p begin="00:23:55.000" end="00:23:55.866" style="s2">I won&#39;t push.</p>
<p begin="00:24:12.433" end="00:24:14.733" style="s2">Cole Hotel Group&#39;s annual gala.</p>
<p begin="00:24:15.000" end="00:24:16.866" style="s2">Three hundred cups of your apple tea,</p>
<p begin="00:24:17.100" end="00:24:18.033" style="s2">plus pastries.</p>
