<p begin="00:24:20.466" end="00:24:22.866" style="s2">named Theo. From Adrian Cole&#39;s office.</p>
<p begin="00:24:27.200" end="00:24:28.233" style="s2">Two weeks ago.</p>
<p begin="00:24:28.866" end="00:24:30.533" style="s2">Before he ever told me who he was.</p>
