<p begin="00:24:34.333" end="00:24:35.700" style="s2">The oven just got fixed,</p>
<p begin="00:24:36.200" end="00:24:38.466" style="s2">and the property taxes are due next month.</p>
<p begin="00:24:38.866" end="00:24:40.700" style="s2">Honey, we need this one.</p>
<p begin="00:24:43.200" end="00:24:44.400" style="s2">We&#39;re going to serve tea.</p>
<p begin="00:24:45.000" end="00:24:46.400" style="s2">Not to be anybody&#39;s date.</p>
<p begin="00:24:47.066" end="00:24:48.866" style="s2">And the invitation he sent you?</p>
<p begin="00:24:57.133" end="00:24:58.833" style="s2">Then at least wear the green dress.</p>
<p begin="00:25:08.433" end="00:25:10.500" style="s2">They hired a diner for the gala?</p>
<p begin="00:25:11.666" end="00:25:12.533" style="s2">It&#39;s charming.</p>
<p begin="00:25:12.833" end="00:25:14.533" style="s2">In a small-town sort of way.</p>
<p begin="00:25:20.800" end="00:25:21.600" style="s2">You came.</p>
<p begin="00:25:23.933" end="00:25:25.033" style="s2">For Maggie&#39;s.</p>
<p begin="00:25:27.933" end="00:25:30.700" style="s2">You should be here. For what you make.</p>
<p begin="00:25:36.866" end="00:25:39.200" style="s2">Babe, you have to meet my dad&#39;s partners tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:25:39.500" end="00:25:42.266" style="s2">Of course. Tonight&#39;s a big night for us.</p>
<p begin="00:25:50.666" end="00:25:54.066" style="s2">Well, look who&#39;s pouring tea at the Cole gala.</p>
<p begin="00:25:54.133" end="00:25:56.000" style="s2">Babe, that&#39;s the farm girl I told you about.</p>
<p begin="00:25:56.000" end="00:25:57.466" style="s2">The one who wouldn&#39;t leave me alone.</p>
<p begin="00:26:05.233" end="00:26:06.266" style="s2">Wouldn&#39;t leave you alone?</p>
<p begin="00:26:07.100" end="00:26:08.300" style="s2">You left me on a train.</p>
<p begin="00:26:08.700" end="00:26:10.133" style="s2">And this is where you ran to?</p>
<p begin="00:26:13.700" end="00:26:14.833" style="s2">What are you doing here?</p>
<p begin="00:26:16.533" end="00:26:18.400" style="s2">I was about to ask you the same thing.</p>
<p begin="00:26:19.400" end="00:26:21.400" style="s2">Brett? Who is this?</p>
<p begin="00:26:25.100" end="00:26:27.900" style="s2">Go on. Introduce me properly, Brett.</p>
<p begin="00:26:28.733" end="00:26:29.633" style="s2">I&#39;m your wife.</p>
<p begin="00:26:30.233" end="00:26:31.666" style="s2">The one you robbed on a train</p>
<p begin="00:26:31.666" end="00:26:32.833" style="s2">the morning after our wedding.</p>
<p begin="00:26:33.200" end="00:26:34.000" style="s2">We&#39;re still married.</p>
<p begin="00:26:35.733" end="00:26:37.233" style="s2">You told me you were single!</p>
<p begin="00:26:40.266" end="00:26:41.633" style="s2">Paige, I can explain—</p>
<p begin="00:26:44.833" end="00:26:46.466" style="s2">He married me for my uncle&#39;s money.</p>
<p begin="00:26:49.500" end="00:26:51.533" style="s2">Then he waited till I fell asleep on the train,</p>
<p begin="00:26:52.400" end="00:26:54.400" style="s2">took my purse, my phone,</p>
<p begin="00:26:55.000" end="00:26:56.000" style="s2">my mother&#39;s ring,</p>
<p begin="00:26:56.433" end="00:26:57.466" style="s2">and left me a letter.</p>
<p begin="00:26:58.933" end="00:27:01.100" style="s2">Your uncle promised me a lot more than he paid.</p>
<p begin="00:27:07.700" end="00:27:08.866" style="s2">So you admit it.</p>
<p begin="00:27:11.100" end="00:27:12.300" style="s2">Look around, Ivy.</p>
<p begin="00:27:12.800" end="00:27:13.800" style="s2">You&#39;re pouring tea.</p>
<p begin="00:27:14.233" end="00:27:15.900" style="s2">You still don&#39;t belong in my world.</p>
<p begin="00:27:22.933" end="00:27:23.900" style="s2">Oh, I get it.</p>
<p begin="00:27:24.000" end="00:27:24.900" style="s2">Traded up already?</p>
<p begin="00:27:25.433" end="00:27:26.733" style="s2">Found yourself a richer one?</p>
<p begin="00:27:27.800" end="00:27:29.500" style="s2">Talk to her like that one more time.</p>
<p begin="00:27:31.633" end="00:27:33.133" style="s2">And who are you supposed to be?</p>
<p begin="00:27:37.433" end="00:27:38.800" style="s2">I can stand up for myself.</p>
<p begin="00:27:44.033" end="00:27:45.866" style="s2">Brett, I have a lawyer.</p>
<p begin="00:27:46.433" end="00:27:48.333" style="s2">I&#39;m getting this marriage declared void.</p>
<p begin="00:27:48.600" end="00:27:49.733" style="s2">Your letter is the proof.</p>
<p begin="00:27:51.800" end="00:27:52.933" style="s2">And my mother&#39;s ring?</p>
<p begin="00:27:54.266" end="00:27:57.600" style="s2">There&#39;s a police report. With your name on it.</p>
<p begin="00:27:59.800" end="00:28:01.600" style="s2">A husband takes his wife&#39;s stuff?</p>
<p begin="00:28:02.100" end="00:28:03.033" style="s2">Cops don&#39;t care.</p>
<p begin="00:28:03.866" end="00:28:05.500" style="s2">You don&#39;t get to fool me anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:28:05.833" end="00:28:06.933" style="s2">Don&#39;t call me again.</p>
<p begin="00:28:12.200" end="00:28:13.133" style="s2">Stay away from Ivy.</p>
<p begin="00:28:17.466" end="00:28:18.266" style="s2">Ladies and gentlemen,</p>
<p begin="00:28:18.533" end="00:28:20.433" style="s2">please direct your attention to the stage.</p>
<p begin="00:28:21.533" end="00:28:25.000" style="s2">Next spring, Cole will break ground on our very first</p>
<p begin="00:28:25.000" end="00:28:28.833" style="s2">lakeside resort in Michigan. Cole Harlow Ridge.</p>
<p begin="00:28:38.900" end="00:28:40.333" style="s2">That&#39;s my mom&#39;s barn.</p>
<p begin="00:28:41.333" end="00:28:42.666" style="s2">She painted that flower.</p>
<p begin="00:28:45.666" end="00:28:47.933" style="s2">The seller signed the purchase agreement last week,</p>
<p begin="00:28:47.933" end="00:28:52.533" style="s2">and we close in ten days. And a special thank-you</p>
<p begin="00:28:52.533" end="00:28:56.233" style="s2">to the man who found us this land. Brett Mercer.</p>
<p begin="00:29:05.633" end="00:29:07.066" style="s2">You think you won tonight?</p>
<p begin="00:29:09.400" end="00:29:12.666" style="s2">Your uncle sold your mom&#39;s orchard.</p>
<p begin="00:29:13.900" end="00:29:15.800" style="s2">And the consent on that contract?</p>
<p begin="00:29:16.133" end="00:29:17.300" style="s2">That&#39;s your signature!</p>
<p begin="00:29:17.700" end="00:29:19.200" style="s2">You signed it yourself!</p>
<p begin="00:29:19.266" end="00:29:20.733" style="s2">The morning of our wedding!</p>
<p begin="00:29:28.800" end="00:29:30.833" style="s2">Ivy... I didn&#39;t know.</p>
<p begin="00:29:34.533" end="00:29:36.033" style="s2">The whole room heard him.</p>
<p begin="00:29:36.400" end="00:29:38.666" style="s2">The tea girl is Walt Calloway&#39;s niece.</p>
<p begin="00:29:40.266" end="00:29:42.466" style="s2">That land you&#39;re building on is my mother&#39;s orchard.</p>
<p begin="00:29:43.866" end="00:29:46.733" style="s2">Your mother&#39;s trust says the land can&#39;t be sold before</p>
<p begin="00:29:46.733" end="00:29:49.233" style="s2">you turn twenty-five without your written consent.</p>
<p begin="00:29:50.133" end="00:29:52.400" style="s2">You gave it. Notarized.</p>
<p begin="00:29:54.800" end="00:29:56.633" style="s2">Along with a power of attorney,</p>
<p begin="00:29:56.633" end="00:29:58.200" style="s2">so your uncle could sign for you.</p>
<p begin="00:29:59.200" end="00:30:01.033" style="s2">Last week he signed the sale as</p>
<p begin="00:30:01.033" end="00:30:04.000" style="s2">trustee, with your consent attached.</p>
<p begin="00:30:07.466" end="00:30:09.200" style="s2">I thought I was signing farm papers.</p>
<p begin="00:30:11.466" end="00:30:12.800" style="s2">Then you should have read them.</p>
<p begin="00:30:14.333" end="00:30:15.866" style="s2">We&#39;re putting this deal on hold.</p>
<p begin="00:30:16.700" end="00:30:18.300" style="s2">The board already approved it.</p>
<p begin="00:30:19.633" end="00:30:22.600" style="s2">Walk away from a signed contract with no legal reason,</p>
<p begin="00:30:23.233" end="00:30:25.400" style="s2">and the seller sues us for millions.</p>
<p begin="00:30:26.666" end="00:30:29.266" style="s2">Then he sells it to the next developer by Friday.</p>
<p begin="00:30:33.066" end="00:30:35.300" style="s2">She&#39;s right. You walk away,</p>
<p begin="00:30:35.300" end="00:30:36.666" style="s2">he sells it to somebody else.</p>
<p begin="00:30:37.733" end="00:30:40.433" style="s2">And don&#39;t you dare pay your way out of this for me.</p>
<p begin="00:30:41.200" end="00:30:42.666" style="s2">If you fix this for me,</p>
<p begin="00:30:43.666" end="00:30:46.533" style="s2">I become exactly what she thinks I am.</p>
<p begin="00:30:48.833" end="00:30:50.000" style="s2">Then what do you want?</p>
<p begin="00:30:53.866" end="00:30:56.600" style="s2">Every piece of paper my uncle signed with my name on it.</p>
<p begin="00:30:56.833" end="00:30:57.833" style="s2">I want copies.</p>
<p begin="00:31:01.033" end="00:31:02.633" style="s2">It&#39;s your consent on that deal.</p>
<p begin="00:31:03.733" end="00:31:05.333" style="s2">You have every right to see them.</p>
<p begin="00:31:07.066" end="00:31:08.433" style="s2">You&#39;ll have them first thing tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:31:17.633" end="00:31:21.833" style="s2">Power of attorney and consent. Notarized at ten forty-two</p>
<p begin="00:31:21.866" end="00:31:25.033" style="s2">a.m. on your wedding day. In the church office.</p>
<p begin="00:31:27.100" end="00:31:28.500" style="s2">I was in my wedding dress.</p>
<p begin="00:31:29.300" end="00:31:31.233" style="s2">He said, &quot;Farm papers.</p>
<p begin="00:31:32.233" end="00:31:33.733" style="s2">Just sign where the tabs are.&quot;</p>
<p begin="00:31:38.733" end="00:31:42.000" style="s2">You can revoke the power of attorney today.</p>
<p begin="00:31:42.000" end="00:31:46.066" style="s2">In writing, delivered to him and to the buyer.</p>
<p begin="00:31:46.066" end="00:31:48.700" style="s2">After that, he can&#39;t sign one more thing in your name.</p>
<p begin="00:31:55.300" end="00:31:57.100" style="s2">But the consent you already gave,</p>
<p begin="00:31:57.300" end="00:31:58.866" style="s2">the contract he already signed?</p>
<p begin="00:31:59.933" end="00:32:01.466" style="s2">Revoking doesn&#39;t touch those.</p>
<p begin="00:32:03.066" end="00:32:05.833" style="s2">Not unless we prove he tricked you into signing.</p>
<p begin="00:32:06.500" end="00:32:08.633" style="s2">Or that as your trustee,</p>
<p begin="00:32:08.666" end="00:32:10.233" style="s2">he was working against you.</p>
<p begin="00:32:14.333" end="00:32:16.433" style="s2">Get me proof he wasn&#39;t acting for you.</p>
<p begin="00:32:17.433" end="00:32:19.233" style="s2">I turn twenty-five in October.</p>
<p begin="00:32:20.333" end="00:32:22.000" style="s2">Then he&#39;s racing your birthday.</p>
<p begin="00:32:22.266" end="00:32:23.800" style="s2">The day you turn twenty-five,</p>
<p begin="00:32:23.800" end="00:32:24.833" style="s2">the land is yours.</p>
<p begin="00:32:25.466" end="00:32:26.600" style="s2">And so are the books.</p>
<p begin="00:32:28.666" end="00:32:31.000" style="s2">Brett didn&#39;t come to Harlow Ridge to look at land.</p>
<p begin="00:32:32.233" end="00:32:33.400" style="s2">He came for me.</p>
<p begin="00:32:37.666" end="00:32:39.233" style="s2">I&#39;ll mail the buyer&#39;s copy.</p>
<p begin="00:32:39.500" end="00:32:40.466" style="s2">Your uncle&#39;s...</p>
<p begin="00:32:40.866" end="00:32:42.466" style="s2">you should hand it to him yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:32:47.200" end="00:32:49.800" style="s2">He&#39;ll come. When he&#39;s winning,</p>
<p begin="00:32:49.800" end="00:32:51.133" style="s2">he likes to look you in the eye.</p>
<p begin="00:32:57.033" end="00:32:58.433" style="s2">Celeste called me.</p>
<p begin="00:32:59.300" end="00:33:01.600" style="s2">Said my niece was pouring tea</p>
<p begin="00:33:01.600" end="00:33:05.433" style="s2">at her party in an apron that says &quot;Maggie&#39;s.&quot;</p>
<p begin="00:33:06.466" end="00:33:09.000" style="s2">Figured you&#39;d be sleeping under a bridge by now.</p>
<p begin="00:33:10.000" end="00:33:11.900" style="s2">Sorry to disappoint you, Uncle Walt.</p>
<p begin="00:33:18.266" end="00:33:19.400" style="s2">It&#39;s a release.</p>
<p begin="00:33:20.866" end="00:33:22.700" style="s2">Says you agreed to the sale</p>
<p begin="00:33:23.300" end="00:33:24.700" style="s2">and you won&#39;t make trouble.</p>
<p begin="00:33:28.300" end="00:33:31.600" style="s2">Sign it, and I&#39;ll give you twenty thousand cash.</p>
<p begin="00:33:32.333" end="00:33:33.466" style="s2">Start over here. Pour</p>
<p begin="00:33:34.133" end="00:33:36.133" style="s2">coffee for the rest of your life.</p>
<p begin="00:33:37.933" end="00:33:40.033" style="s2">Why did Brett marry me, Uncle Walt?</p>
<p begin="00:33:41.933" end="00:33:44.100" style="s2">&#39;Cause nobody else was gonna.</p>
<p begin="00:33:45.866" end="00:33:47.233" style="s2">How much did you pay him?</p>
<p begin="00:33:49.133" end="00:33:49.933" style="s2">Enough.</p>
<p begin="00:33:53.400" end="00:33:54.866" style="s2">You fight me on this,</p>
<p begin="00:33:55.433" end="00:33:57.466" style="s2">I&#39;ll tell everybody in Harlow Ridge</p>
<p begin="00:33:57.466" end="00:33:59.433" style="s2">you ran off with some city boy</p>
<p begin="00:34:00.000" end="00:34:02.800" style="s2">and dumped your mother&#39;s debts on your poor uncle.</p>
<p begin="00:34:08.000" end="00:34:09.466" style="s2">Who do you think they&#39;ll believe?</p>
<p begin="00:34:10.300" end="00:34:12.333" style="s2">That land was my father&#39;s.</p>
<p begin="00:34:13.000" end="00:34:15.600" style="s2">Your mother had no right leaving it to a girl.</p>
<p begin="00:34:20.666" end="00:34:22.500" style="s2">My lawyer said to give you this myself.</p>
<p begin="00:34:23.633" end="00:34:26.900" style="s2">As of today, you can&#39;t sign anything in my name.</p>
<p begin="00:34:28.000" end="00:34:29.833" style="s2">Go tell the town whatever you want.</p>
<p begin="00:34:31.266" end="00:34:33.033" style="s2">Then a judge can hear why.</p>
<p begin="00:34:39.833" end="00:34:40.633" style="s2">Doesn&#39;t matter.</p>
<p begin="00:34:42.133" end="00:34:43.066" style="s2">Contract&#39;s signed.</p>
<p begin="00:34:43.800" end="00:34:45.600" style="s2">And the closing got moved up. Wednesday, nine a.m.</p>
<p begin="00:34:49.000" end="00:34:51.033" style="s2">Celeste wants it done before you make a scene.</p>
<p begin="00:34:55.000" end="00:34:57.133" style="s2">You don&#39;t belong in our world, Ivy.</p>
<p begin="00:34:58.400" end="00:34:59.433" style="s2">You never did.</p>
<p begin="00:35:01.600" end="00:35:03.833" style="s2">Out. Get out of my café.</p>
<p begin="00:35:09.266" end="00:35:10.066" style="s2">Three days.</p>
<p begin="00:35:16.666" end="00:35:17.833" style="s2">What are you doing here?</p>
<p begin="00:35:21.266" end="00:35:22.233" style="s2">Paige dumped me.</p>
<p begin="00:35:22.466" end="00:35:24.466" style="s2">And your uncle says if the sale doesn&#39;t close,</p>
<p begin="00:35:24.666" end="00:35:25.900" style="s2">I don&#39;t get another dime.</p>
<p begin="00:35:27.066" end="00:35:29.533" style="s2">Ivy, let&#39;s start over.</p>
<p begin="00:35:29.933" end="00:35:30.800" style="s2">We&#39;re still married.</p>
<p begin="00:35:31.466" end="00:35:33.266" style="s2">Half that land money&#39;s mine anyway. Come</p>
<p begin="00:35:33.800" end="00:35:35.800" style="s2">back, we split it,</p>
<p begin="00:35:36.000" end="00:35:37.300" style="s2">and we&#39;re set for life.</p>
<p begin="00:35:42.700" end="00:35:44.933" style="s2">That land is what my mother left me.</p>
<p begin="00:35:45.866" end="00:35:47.600" style="s2">It&#39;s got nothing to do with you.</p>
<p begin="00:35:49.833" end="00:35:52.700" style="s2">My lawyer says an inheritance isn&#39;t marital property.</p>
<p begin="00:36:05.633" end="00:36:07.233" style="s2">You left these with me on that train.</p>
<p begin="00:36:08.133" end="00:36:12.400" style="s2">I kept them so I&#39;d remember the day I was a fool. Take them.</p>
<p begin="00:36:14.000" end="00:36:15.300" style="s2">I don&#39;t need them anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:36:19.466" end="00:36:21.066" style="s2">I&#39;m never coming back to you.</p>
<p begin="00:36:21.900" end="00:36:23.933" style="s2">You think Walt&#39;s some honest farmer</p>
<p begin="00:36:24.100" end="00:36:25.666" style="s2">buried under your mom&#39;s debts?</p>
<p begin="00:36:26.266" end="00:36:27.466" style="s2">He stiffed me too.</p>
<p begin="00:36:28.333" end="00:36:29.933" style="s2">Ask him where the orchard money went.</p>
<p begin="00:36:30.133" end="00:36:31.933" style="s2">Ask him about the casino in Battle Creek.</p>
<p begin="00:36:44.666" end="00:36:46.866" style="s2">Everything your uncle gave us to justify the price.</p>
<p begin="00:36:47.433" end="00:36:48.600" style="s2">Five years of financials.</p>
<p begin="00:36:52.500" end="00:36:53.433" style="s2">The trust papers.</p>
<p begin="00:36:54.300" end="00:36:56.100" style="s2">A draft of the closing statement.</p>
<p begin="00:36:56.900" end="00:36:58.533" style="s2">It&#39;s your consent on that deal.</p>
<p begin="00:36:59.433" end="00:37:01.300" style="s2">You have a right to see what&#39;s behind it.</p>
<p begin="00:37:03.700" end="00:37:05.133" style="s2">You didn&#39;t have to do this.</p>
<p begin="00:37:09.333" end="00:37:10.700" style="s2">I&#39;m not fixing anything.</p>
<p begin="00:37:11.400" end="00:37:12.733" style="s2">I&#39;m just handing you the books.</p>
<p begin="00:37:23.100" end="00:37:25.733" style="s2">Three years ago. New tractor.</p>
<p begin="00:37:26.433" end="00:37:27.400" style="s2">Sixty-eight thousand. We&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:37:28.133" end="00:37:30.300" style="s2">had the same red tractor since I was nine.</p>
<p begin="00:37:30.700" end="00:37:32.000" style="s2">He never replaced it.</p>
<p begin="00:37:35.866" end="00:37:36.666" style="s2">Picking wages. Harold</p>
<p begin="00:37:37.466" end="00:37:38.400" style="s2">Bixby,</p>
<p begin="00:37:38.433" end="00:37:39.300" style="s2">four hundred hours.</p>
<p begin="00:37:40.200" end="00:37:41.733" style="s2">Harold died four years ago.</p>
